<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Hi,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Someone requested a password reset for your account. If this was you, click the button below:</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="background-color: #0d6efd; border-radius: 8px;">
      <a href="<%= @reset_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 14px 32px; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">Reset Password</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">This link will expire in 15 minutes.</p>

<p style="margin: 0; color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
